      "body": "YOU CAN DO IT, @maniarathi !! 👏 🎉 \r\n\r\nSince Safari has this weird between word spacing issue, maybe we can try replacing`width: 150px;` to:\r\n\r\n```css\r\nmin-width: 150px;\r\nmax-width: Npx; /** whatever pixel width that makes the button looks great on Safari */\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis way hopefully Chrome and Firefox will just use ~150px for the button, and only Safari will hit `max-width`!\r\n\r\nThe file is: `frontend/src/components/CookieBanner/style.ts:47`\r\n\r\nHope this helps! Thank you for taking on this 🚀 ⭐ !",
